.TH "dcml2pnm" 1 "Thu Jul 9 2026 18:43:40" "Version 3.7.0" "OFFIS DCMTK" \" -*- nroff -*-
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dcml2pnm \- Convert DICOM images to PGM/PPM, PNG, TIFF or BMP 
.PP

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
.PP
.nf
dcml2pnm [options] dcmfile-in [bitmap-out]
.fi
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The \fBdcml2pnm\fP tool is deprecated\&. Use \fBdcm2img\fP instead, which supports the same command line parameters, and more\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
